<title>UK: Tennis-One of &quot;old crew&quot; to win Wimbledon, says Sampras.</title>
<headline>Tennis-One of &quot;old crew&quot; to win Wimbledon, says Sampras.</headline>
<byline>Jeremy Laurence</byline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>World number one Pete Sampras said on Saturday he did not expect the unpredictable nature of the French Open and last year's Wimbledon championship to carry over to this year's grasscourt grand slam tournament.</p>
<p>The American predicted one of the 'old crew' would lift the men's title, but added in-form Australian Mark Philippoussis could also be a force when the tournament starts on Monday.</p>
</text>
